      "problem": "Given that $r(t)=⟨\\sqrt{t},\\,t-3⟩,$ $|r(5)|=$",
      "worked_solution": "Evaluating the function at $t=5,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r(5) & =⟨\\sqrt{5},\\,5-3⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\sqrt{5},\\,2⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing the magnitude of this vector, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|r(5)| & =\\sqrt{{(\\sqrt{5})}^{2}+{(2)}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{5+4} \\\\  & =3.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
